{"text": "From: Cornelius Abara <cabara@abaralund.example>\nTo: Stephanie Lund <slund@abaralund.example>\nDate: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:17:40 -0800\nSubject: new client - Fairweather Orchards - setup list (sent from my phone, sorry)\n\nSteph,\n\nDictating this from the car so forgive the format. Signed Fairweather Orchards & Cider Mill, Inc. today.\nFamily outfit outside Cashmere, about 2.8 million in revenue, books are a mess. Monthly\nbookkeeping plus the corporate return, eighteen hundred a month.\n\nContacts, since their email addresses never come through right when I type them:\n- Deborah Fairweather, president. deb dot fairweather at fairweather-orchards dot example. Cell\n  five oh nine, 555, oh one three four. She wants everything to go to her, not to her brother.\n- Robert Kessinger, the outside bookkeeper they are letting go. He does not know yet so do NOT\n  contact him before Friday. When you do: bob underscore k at mail dot example dot com.\n  Deb says Bob has the only admin login to QuickBooks. User is rkessinger and she thinks the\n  password is Honeycrisp#1987 but would not swear to it.\n\nThings I need from you this week:\n1. Engagement letter and Form 8821 (not 2848 yet) out to Deb by Friday.\n2. Bank feeds. Operating account is at Wenatchee Valley Bank, routing 124921793, account\n   4400187726. Payroll account ends in 3091. Deb will add you as a view-only user.\n3. Their EIN is 91-1840276. State UBI 604 118 227.\n4. Put the software subscription on the firm card for now and bill it through. Amex,\n   3714 788330 86605, expires 08/29, four digit code on the front is 4026. Please do not\n   leave that in the client folder.\n5. Deb mentioned in passing that her brother Paris Delacroix (half-brother, different last\n   name) took a \"loan\" of about 60k out of the company in May and that he is\n   in rehab in Spokane right now. She does not want it discussed with staff there.\n   Book it to a shareholder receivable until we know more. Paris owns 20 percent.\n\nQ3 payroll returns were filed late, there will be notices. W-2 season is going to be fun.\n\nThanks\nCornelius\n\nAbara Lund & Co., CPAs | 320 Orondo Avenue, 2nd Floor | Wenatchee, WA 98801", "kind": "Email", "detail": "363 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Cornelius Abara", "Stephanie Lund", "Deborah Fairweather", "Robert Kessinger", "Paris Delacroix"], "companies": ["Fairweather Orchards", "Fairweather Orchards & Cider Mill, Inc.", "Wenatchee Valley Bank", "QuickBooks", "Abara Lund & Co., CPAs"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Fairweather Orchards", "Cashmere", "Wenatchee Valley Bank", "Spokane", "320 Orondo Avenue", "Wenatchee"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["Paris Delacroix", "rehab"], "names": ["Cornelius", "Stephanie", "Deborah", "Robert", "Paris"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.6999999992549419, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 6, "end": 21, "text": "Cornelius Abara", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Cornelius Abara"}, {"start": 23, "end": 47, "text": "cabara@abaralund.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "cabara@abaralund.example"}, {"start": 53, "end": 67, "text": "Stephanie Lund", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Stephanie Lund"}, {"start": 69, "end": 92, "text": "slund@abaralund.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "slund@abaralund.example"}, {"start": 100, "end": 115, "text": "Wed, 4 Nov 2026", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "Wed, 4 Nov 2026"}, {"start": 153, "end": 173, "text": "Fairweather Or